529}, {"h": 0.0075872089888644875, "text": "Kirsten:", "y": 0.6284738372395794, "w": 0.035778172810872366, "x": 0.7137745982099485}, {"x": 0.7137745989734446, "text": "Emily:", "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "w": 0.028622538248697982, "y": 0.6373255815099281}, {"text": "so, go with Theo", "y": 0.630907039655064, "h": 0.0064185415622559664, "x": 0.7638640451858972, "w": 0.06976743910047734}, {"x": 0.7513416821772583, "y": 0.6373255815520793, "w": 0.03220035764906137, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "text": "Well."}, {"text": "Wayne has a lot of friends. He's", "x": 0.7817531318552078, "h": 0.007628295073010009, "y": 0.6385901164779515, "w": 0.1270125155978732}, {"x": 0.8121645847355793, "text": "(sociable) than Theo. Theo is", "w": 0.1198568810356988, "y": 0.6473962093340381, "h": 0.0076328602766732164}, {"h": 0.010289753021315995, "x": 0.8121645819470672, "text": "(shy). Maybe its better to go", "y": 0.6548555955753058, "w": 0.11627906799316412}, {"x": 0.749552769659231, "w": 0.17531305948893228, "text": "to the dance with Wayne, but it's a difficult", "y": 0.6626162792736953, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"x": 0.7512718594786884, "h": 0.006729385766742028, "y": 0.6712646675394254, "w": 0.03591782040066194, "text": "decision"}, {"y": 0.6768560972325366, "x": 0.7117382575049106, "h": 0.013102311984726646, "w": 0.22769170125325522, "text": "Kirsten: Yes, but it's less difficult than deciding what to"}, {"x": 0.7495527752747759, "y": 0.6878339350767252, "text": "wear. That's impossible!", "w": 0.09660107082790803, "h": 0.007851985559566801}, {"y": 0.6985504649362748, "x": 0.7207174439686981, "h": 0.011142719747357413, "w": 0.2168594699435763, "text": "* Complete the sentences with the correct forms"}, {"text": "of the adjectives in capitals.", "w": 0.1198568810356988, "x": 0.7119856933596104, "y": 0.7068750001354321, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"text": "My murn is lae than my dad but the", "x": 0.7245080508453983, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "y": 0.7168862816673072, "w": 0.153